OL,5,G0325 Gary Barlow's Food and Wine Tour:
OL,6,G     New Zealand
OL,7,     FGary and Jason Manford explore
OL,8,     FCentral Otago, a region in the
OL,9,     FSouth Island of New Zealand. The
OL,10,     FTake That star's destination is
OL,11,     FCloudy Bay, a winery he has
OL,12,     Fdreamed of visiting for years, and
OL,13,     Fwhere the pair learn how grapes
OL,14,     Fare tested before harvest. Along
OL,15,     Fthe way, the duo also enjoy a
OL,16,     Fproper Kiwi pie breakfast, brave
OL,17,     Frope bridges with epic mountain
OL,18,     Fviews and take on a slippery
OL,19,     Fdriving challenge at a motor sport
OL,20,     Fpark
